## Starting a task

A session handed a brief starts from it instead (`core/modules/other-builders.md`).

1. Take the main lane's next entry in `docs/PROGRESS.md`. Its issue is the spec; a stage with no issue, its text there.
2. Read what `node core/scripts/reading.mjs builder --issue <its issue>` prints for it, and besides only what that
   entry names.

